# Mutation plan for crates/gobwire (Phase 1, docs/PLUGIN_PLAN.md).
#
#   MUTATE_PACKAGE=gobwire scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/gobwire.plan
#
# The decisions: the primitive encodings, which zero values Go omits, merge-versus-replace on
# decode for every container, the interface type-sequence boundary rule, Go's compile-time
# compatibility checks, range checks, time.Time's binary quirks, and dynamic recursion.
# The EQUIVALENT- and CONTROL- lines at the end must SURVIVE.

